{"c":"473018","n":"ČELADENKA 1","t":"P","s":"MS","o":"Frýdlant nad Ostravicí","url":"473018-celadenka-1","stav":"2026-10-11","popis":"GPS Z:49°34'6.847\"N, 18°21'46.536\"E, K:49°27'11.437\"N, 18°22'13.214\"E \nPřítok Ostravice, Odry. Od ústí do Ostravice v Nové Dědině u Frýdlantu nad Ostravicí až k pramenům.\nK revíru patří odlehčovací kanál pod silnicí Frenštátská v délce 280 m z podjezí Frýdlantské Ondřejnice GPS 49°34'3.781\"N, 18°21'18.105\"E až po soutok s Čeladenkou GPS 49°34'4.695\"N, 18°21'31.439\"E.\nVšechny přítoky a tok Čeladenky od soutoku s Dešťanským potokem až k pramenům jsou chovné – lov ryb zakázán. Lov muškařením bez omezení.","delka":17,"rozloha":7,"lat":49.507686,"lon":18.350619,"mo_web":"https://www.rybsvaz.cz/mo/-/frydlant-nad-ostravici","mo_tel":"+420603770802","mo_mail":"info@rybarifrydlantno.cz","doba":[{"od":"2026-10-01","do":"2026-10-31","h":"07:00–19:00","zakaz":false}],"kratkodobe":[],"miry":[{"d":"Amur bílý","min":50,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Bolen dravý","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":"povinnost ponechat si"},{"d":"Candát obecný","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Cejn velký","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Hlavatka obecná","min":65,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-10-01","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Jelec jesen","min":25,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Jelec tloušť","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":"povinnost ponechat si"},{"d":"Jeseter malý","min":30,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Kapr obecný","min":40,"max":70,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Lín obecný","min":25,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Lipan p